llel`, as specified in docs/research/2026-11-13-direction-2-design.md sections 2.6 and 2.8 (step G-3).; A Project with the key set and no built-in review (`defaults.review = none`) still gets a parallel Verdict for each PR head it gates. Those rows count toward reliability, inconclusive share, wrong-head and latency, and never toward recall.; Parallel Verdicts and their findings are stored only. They never reach the author, never block or allow Publish or Merge, and a Greenhouse failure or refusal never delays the built-in loop. A failure raises at most one Notice per head.; `posse stats` gains a review comparison that computes every G1 threshold in section 2.6 from stored rows, per Project and in total, with the number of reviewed heads.; The key is frozen in each admitted Task's plan. Unsetting it stops new parallel requests and changes nothing else.; No change to existing review, publish or merge behaviour when the key is unset.","Paths":["docs/research/2026-11-13-direction-2-design.md","docs/spec.md","internal/app/greenhouse.go","internal/app/project_remove_test.go","internal/app/review_comparison.go","internal/app/review_comparison_test.go","internal/app/review_rounds.go","internal/app/stats.go","internal/app/task_plan.go","internal/config/config.go","internal/config/config_test.go","internal/config/schema.go","internal/e2e/profile_stats_test.go","internal/store/greenhouse_requests.go","internal/store/greenhouse_verdicts.go","internal/store/greenhouse_verdicts_test.go","internal/store/migrations/00097_greenhouse_review_requests.sql","internal/taskplan/plan.go","internal/taskplan/plan_test.go"],"ReviewBudget":"3m0s","Snapshot":{"Commit":"bd2af87f244b4c63b640efa29e893dfc2de5ddc1","Tree":"acac0be083b04f21531e46a8a171d69ea7e968a7","Digest":"ff3824e64399468cd0c94d0a5ecaae31e6f198e8daec1e22dda0e23db4fcc856"},"Target":"7dde4fe1d9c34c313354c23f76446258a4b7b208"}

